					<description><![CDATA[NASA astronaut Anil Menon took this selfie during a spacewalk on Oct. 29, 2026. He and CSA (Canadian Space Agency) astronaut Joshua Kutryk installed a new roll-out solar array on the International Space Station. Get daily updates from the space station. Image credit: NASA/Anil Menon]]></description>
