vw, 2048px" /></a></figure><figcaption class="hds-caption padding-y-2"><div class="hds-credits">NASA/Anil Menon</div></figcaption></div></div></div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">NASA astronaut Anil Menon took this selfie during a spacewalk on Oct. 29, 2026. He and CSA (Canadian Space Agency) astronaut Joshua Kutryk installed a new roll-out solar array on the International Space Station.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://www.nasa.gov/blogs/spacestation/">Get daily updates from the space station.</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Image credit: NASA/Anil Menon</em></p>
]]></content:encoded>



